Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:04.01,Secondary,,0,0,0,,大家好，欢迎回到本频道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone and welcome back to the channel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.32,Secondary,,0,0,0,,条条大路通罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Many roads lead to rome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:11.70,Secondary,,0,0,0,,但只有少数几条能通向虚幻引擎中的交互式植被
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But only a few lead to interactive foliage in unreal engine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:15.19,Secondary,,0,0,0,,有多种方式，比如世界位置偏移（WPO）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There are multiple ways like world position offset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:18.56,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Pivot Painter 或骨骼网格体系统
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pivot painter or skeletal mesh systems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:22.12,Secondary,,0,0,0,,本期视频我们将重点介绍一种简单且轻量级的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,in this video we'll focus on a simple and lightweight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:26.37,Secondary,,0,0,0,,基于世界位置偏移的草地交互方案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,World position offset based setup for gress interaction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:30.96,Secondary,,0,0,0,,另外，我已经在制作一期单独的 Pivot Painter 教程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While i'm already working on a separate pivot painter tutorial
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:35.68,Secondary,,0,0,0,,世界位置偏移属于材质系统的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,World position offset is part of the material system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:41.02,Secondary,,0,0,0,,例如，风效果通常就是使用 WPO 制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For example , wind effects are typically created using wp o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:47.12,Secondary,,0,0,0,,大多数植被资源包已经使用了内置的 MS Foliage 植被材质
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,most quicks of foliage assets already use the internal ms foliage material
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.44,Secondary,,0,0,0,,其中已经设置好了风效果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the wind is set up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:54.38,Secondary,,0,0,0,,你只需把今天讲的交互添加到现有的 WPO 中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can simply add today's interaction to the existing wp o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:57.77,Secondary,,0,0,0,,再把它重新接入世界位置偏移
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and plug it back into the world position offset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:01:00.87,Secondary,,0,0,0,,或者将其用于你自己的材质设置中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or use it in your own material setup
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:04.64,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们的草地应该只在玩家靠近时产生反应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our grass should only react when the player is close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:08.99,Secondary,,0,0,0,,因此我们需要一个基于玩家位置的遮罩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So we need a mask based on the player's position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.80,Secondary,,0,0,0,,由于在材质中无法直接访问玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we can't access the player directly in the material
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:17.45,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们通过材质参数集来传递位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We sent the position through a material parameter collection
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:21.01,Secondary,,0,0,0,,打开它并添加一个新的向量参数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it and add a new vector parameter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.41,Secondary,,0,0,0,,将其命名为 Player Position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And name it player position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.86,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在打开你的玩家蓝图
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open your player blueprint
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.19,Secondary,,0,0,0,,在事件图表中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In the event graph
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:30.45,Secondary,,0,0,0,,添加一个“设置向量参数值”节点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Add a set vector parameter value note
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:36.43,Secondary,,0,0,0,,选择你的参数集，并为数值选择 Player Position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Select your collection and choose player position for the value use
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.43,Secondary,,0,0,0,,使用“获取 Actor 位置”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get act or location
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:41.83,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这会自动将位置转换为一种格式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This automatically converts the position into a format
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.92,Secondary,,0,0,0,,让材质能够读取
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the material can read
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.68,Secondary,,0,0,0,,连接到事件 Tick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Connected to event tick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:50.87,Secondary,,0,0,0,,但别担心，像这样更新单个参数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry . updating a single parameter like this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:54.05,Secondary,,0,0,0,,不会造成明显的性能影响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Has no no to sybil performance impact
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:58.90,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在打开你的草地材质，并添加一个集合参数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open your grass material and add a collection parameter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:01:59.83,Secondary,,0,0,0,,节点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:01:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Note
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:04.03,Secondary,,0,0,0,,选择你的集合，并选中 Player Position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign your collection and select player position
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:07.56,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们只需要 X、Y 和 Z 值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We only need x , y and z values
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.93,Secondary,,0,0,0,,所以右键单击并添加一个组件蒙版
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So right click and add a component mask
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:14.70,Secondary,,0,0,0,,节点，然后启用 R、G 和 B
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Note : then enable r , g and b
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:18.01,Secondary,,0,0,0,,右键单击并搜索 World Position
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right click and search for world's position
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.89,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这会添加一个绝对世界位置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This will add an absolute world position
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:26.92,Secondary,,0,0,0,,节点，然后使用减法节点从中减去玩家位置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Note : then subtract the player's position from it using a subtract node
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:32.26,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样我们就得到了从草指向玩家的方向向量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives us the direction vector from the grass to the player
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:37.00,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在用Vector Length节点计算距离
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we calculate the distance using a vector length note
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.26,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后除以一个缩放参数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then divided by a scale of parameter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.63,Secondary,,0,0,0,,来控制影响范围的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To control the size of the effect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:47.42,Secondary,,0,0,0,,把它命名为Radius，默认值设为100左右
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Name it radius and sets the default value to around one hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:53.45,Secondary,,0,0,0,,接着用Power节点来塑造衰减曲线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we use a power note to shape the fall off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:58.56,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样过渡会随数值变得更平滑或更锐利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So the transition becomes smoother or sharper depending on the value
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:03.37,Secondary,,0,0,0,,把指数提升为参数，命名为Falloff
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Promote the exponent to a parameter and name it fall off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:06.14,Secondary,,0,0,0,,暂时先把值设为1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For now we set the value to one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:15.13,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后用Saturate钳制结果，保持在干净的0到1范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we clamp the result using saturrate to keep it in a clean zero to one range
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:18.85,Secondary,,0,0,0,,最后用1减去它来做反转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally we inverted using one minus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:23.88,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样效果在玩家附近最强，向外逐渐衰减
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So the effect is the strongest close to the player and fates outwards
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:26.90,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在遮罩已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that our mask is ready
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:29.20,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们先让草向下压
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We first pushed the grass down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.59,Secondary,,0,0,0,,在玩家站立的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the player is standing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:36.16,Secondary,,0,0,0,,用一个缩放参数，命名为Z Offset
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At a scale of parameter name it z offset
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.72,Secondary,,0,0,0,,把它设为-50左右
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And set it to around negative fifty
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:44.30,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后右键搜索Make Vector3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then right click and search for make vector three
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:47.43,Secondary,,0,0,0,,把缩放值连到B输入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluck the scale of value into the b input
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.80,Secondary,,0,0,0,,并把R和G设为0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And set r and g to zero
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.79,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后用遮罩乘以这个向量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then multiplied this vector or with a mask
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:58.18,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样只有半径内的区域会受到影响
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So only the area inside the radius gets affected
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:03.07,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在把结果连到World Position Offset
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now pluck the result into the world's position offset
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:08.25,Secondary,,0,0,0,,如果已经有风的效果，就叠加在它上面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is already a wind setup at your result on top of it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:12.45,Secondary,,0,0,0,,否则直接连到WPO
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise plug it directly into the wp o
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:14.91,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在可以测试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can test it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:16.38,Secondary,,0,0,0,,生效了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It works
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:19.33,Secondary,,0,0,0,,草被玩家压下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The grass is pushed down by the player
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:23.28,Secondary,,0,0,0,,接下来添加弯曲效果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's add bending
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:27.92,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们取之前距离计算的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We take the result from our earlier distance calculation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:31.32,Secondary,,0,0,0,,也就是世界位置减去玩家位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The world position minus the player position
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:37.48,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后乘以一个常量向量，设为110
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we multiply it with a constant three vector or set to one one zero
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:41.22,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样只影响X和Y，忽略Z
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So we only affect x and y but ignore a z
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:47.13,Secondary,,0,0,0,,之后对结果做归一化，保持方向干净
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,After that we normalized the result to keep the direction clean
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:50.87,Secondary,,0,0,0,,再乘以一个弯曲强度参数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we multiply it with a bent strength parameter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.39,Secondary,,0,0,0,,用来控制效果的强度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,To control how strong the effect is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:58.95,Secondary,,0,0,0,,弯曲强度的起始值用50左右
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use a starting value of around fifty for the band strength
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:03.41,Secondary,,0,0,0,,接下来从这个节点接一个LinearGradient节点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Next at a linear gradient note from this node
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.86,Secondary,,0,0,0,,我们使用V方向渐变输出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We used a v gradient output
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:10.53,Secondary,,0,0,0,,因为它能给出从下到上的垂直渐变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it gives us the vertical gradient from button to top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:13.73,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后我们用 1 减去它来反转
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,then we invert it using one minus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:20.32,Secondary,,0,0,0,,因为我们希望草在底部保持稳定，只在顶部弯曲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we want the grass to stay stable at the bottom and only bent towards the top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:24.08,Secondary,,0,0,0,,之后，我们将它与弯曲倍数相乘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After that , we multiply it with our band multiplier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:27.09,Secondary,,0,0,0,,来控制效果的强度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,To control the strength of the effect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:30.41,Secondary,,0,0,0,,现在我们把它与遮罩相乘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we multiplied this with our mask
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.03,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这样弯曲就只会发生在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So the banding only happens
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.29,Secondary,,0,0,0,,交互半径之内
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,insight the interaction radius
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:38.59,Secondary,,0,0,0,,然后我们把它加到 Z 偏移上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we added to our z offset
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:42.03,Secondary,,0,0,0,,将两种效果结合成最终结果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,combining both effects into the final result
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.22,Secondary,,0,0,0,,在材质实例中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the material instance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:55.56,Secondary,,0,0,0,,你现在可以轻松调整所有参数，比如弯曲强度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can now easily tweak all parameters like ben's strength
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:59.28,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Z 偏移和半径，来调节效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Z offset and radius to adjust the effect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:03.35,Secondary,,0,0,0,,这非常适合草和小型植被
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This works really well for grass and small foliage
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:09.16,Secondary,,0,0,0,,而更大的植物或树木通常更适合用 Pivot Painter 设置来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While larger plants or trees are usually better handled with pivot painter setups
